Package: partisanHeads2015
Title: Guessing the Backgrounds of Randomly Drawn Partisans
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Douglas J.", "Ahler", role = "aut"),
    person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "gsood07@gmail.com")
  )
Description: Data preparation, benchmarks, estimation, exhibits and manuscript for
    a 2013 survey asking partisans to guess the backgrounds of a randomly drawn
    Democrat and Republican.
